60
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Then use the line sewing tool to sew the two sides together.

61
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:27,000
After sewing, this plate will hold up.

62
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Then we activate the top of this plate,

63
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,000
